Z||000005||jch82||04-08-2001||10:42 PM||||I am in the process of redoing the interior (as you could tell from the pics). I am going to get the 120speedo and aux gauges along with white face overlays. I am also going to vinyl the headliner and the lower parts of the doors because that carpet is just gross looking.....<P>I plan on repainting it either hugger orange (with black roof/spoiler) or the stock colors. I really want to go with orange. We will have to see though.....On another note, it will have a spoiler because I really don't like the luggage rack. I want to put in a sunroof but have to check out a few junkyards to get some prices.....<P>Sometime next fall I think I'm going to put in a low mileage 2.8 or possibly 3.4 (depending on money situation)along with the M19 (4:10) tranny and a new clutch. <P>That's all I can think of for now but I'm sure there will be more later on.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||1
